{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The World of Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Do I Include That?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe jobs and careers in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Intonation of Finished and Unfinished Ideas", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Intonation tells us a lot about how someone feels and whether they have completed their thoughts or not. It is important to listen carefully to the rise and fall of people's voices.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In English, there there are <span class=\"strong\">three</span> intonation patterns:<ol><li>Falling</li> <li>Rising </li><li>Partial Falling </li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You should use falling intonation at the end of a thought group or sentence to tell the listener that you are finished with that statement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br><span class=\"italic\">These skills are often called transferable skills because you can transfer them from one job to another. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Likewise, your pitch will only partially fall at the end of a thought group to:<br><ul><li>give the listener's brain time to \u201cdigest\u201d the speech; and </li><li> tell the listener that you are not finished speaking</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br><span class=\"italic\">I have another question to ask you but ...", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Statement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comment\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">When I'm including skills on my master r\u00e9sum\u00e9 ... how do I know if it's hard skill ... or a soft skill? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"At every ellipsis, the speaker's voice partially falls, signalling that there is more to come. Note that even though the idea is complete at the end, because it is a question, the voice does not fully fall.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I always get them confused.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"At the end of the sentence, the voice fully falls, showing that the sentence is finished.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking about Jobs and Career Plans", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A career plan is a structured process for analyzing your skills and interests, formulating long-term goals and coming up with strategies to achieve them. An important part of your career plan is deciding on the job you will have. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Jobs can be categorized in many different ways. Jobs with common characteristics are associated with certain sectors (a category, grouping, or division) of our economy. The different types of sectors are:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Service </li><li> Resource </li><li> Business </li><li> Health</li><li>  Education</li><li>  Art/Culture</li></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "urban planner ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who develops plans to create communities, accommodate growth, or revitalize physical facilities in cities", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example:  Urban planners plan and collect data. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear when talking about different jobs.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "graphic designer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who combines pictures, words, and art in the production of books, magazines etc. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Graphic designers need to be able to use specific programs.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "UX/UI designer ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who designs a program so that it makes sense to the target user group ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Using that program would be considered a hard skill for a UX/UI designer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "marketing coordinator", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who assists the marketing manager in putting together campaigns for clients  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  What are the skills you need to become a marketing coordinator?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "editorial assistant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who works in publishing, does secretarial work and gets to write, or edit ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Proficiency with inPrint could be considered a hard skill for an editorial assistant. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find a partner. Talk to him/her about 